  Reel script says the opening is attended by MP Rajesh Kumar (ராஜ்ஜிய சபா எம்.பி. ராஜேஸ்குமார் கலந்துகொள்கிறார்); the article only says he will inaugurate the new branch (புதிய கிளையை ... ராஜேஸ்குமார்), which is not the same claim as attending as a participant, so this wording is inaccurate.
  Reel script says the Rasipuram branch offer runs for 25 and 26 'ஆகிய இரண்டு நாட்களுக்கு' but the article's offer is tied to the 'ராசிபுரம் கிளையில்' branch while the article's text places the 25/26 offer context ambiguously; the reel also omits that the 'Rs 480/360/400' Diwali prices and the 27-to-Nov 9 sale period are not mentioned, which are important facts of the article missing from the reel_script.
  Reel script omits the Diwali sale details (27 முதல் நவ. 9 வரை; லட்டு, பாதுஷா, சோன்பப்டி, ஜிலேபி at 480, Special Mixer 360, Mini Jilebi 400), which are important facts of the article.
