factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 8 problems
  tamil_headline and caption say '3 பேர்' (3 people) arrested, but the article says all 4 were arrested (the 4 people caught were all arrested/case registered); 'இலங்கையைச் சேர்ந்த 3 பேர்' misstates the count
  reel_script says 'இலங்கையைச் சேர்ந்த மூன்று பேர் கைது செய்யப்பட்டுள்ளனர்' (three Sri Lankans arrested) which conflicts with the article's 4 people caught and the registered case against all 4
  reel_script states 'இருபது லட்சம் ரூபாய் முன்பணம்' as a bare fact without the context that the ₹1 crore demand and ₹20 lakh advance were the detainees' own claim in investigation; the reel_script also omits the ₹1 crore demand, which is important context for the advance
  slides_spec 'யார் இவர்கள்?' slide says 'இலங்கையைச் சேர்ந்த 3 பேர் கைது' repeating the wrong count of arrests, and omits the fact that the boat driver Muthuraja is from Rameswaram (it does mention him) while listing the Sri Lankan count incorrectly
  slides_spec 'என்ன திட்டம்?' slide says '₹1 கோடி கேட்டு ₹20 லட்சம் முன்பணம் அனுப்பப்பட்டது' as a fact, while the article attributes this to statements made by the detained men; the source of the claim is not conveyed
  slides_spec 'என்ன நடந்தது?' slide says the 4 were 'இலங்கையிலிருந்து வந்தவர்கள்' (came from Sri Lanka), but Muthuraja is from Rameswaram and was the boat operator, so not all four came from Sri Lanka
  caption says 'படகை ஓட்டி வந்தவர் ராமேசுவரத்தைச் சேர்ந்த முத்துராஜா' which is correct, but the reel_script omits the key fact that the Sri Lankan Dharshan from Namakkal had arranged the boat trip and that the boat was unregistered/no registration number, an important cause detail
  reel_script omits the key fact that the men were arrested at dawn after landing on the Pamban beach by boat from international waters and that the boat trip was arranged for pay of ₹1.10 lakh
